{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146073-congrats-to-the-gentleman-gamer","id":1146073,"title":"Congrats to the Gentleman Gamer!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-02T09:24:11-07:00","id":1146073,"title":"Congrats to the Gentleman Gamer!","content":"<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">From a WW newsletter email</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;Matthew Dawkins - Story Writer Matthew Dawkins is one of our lead writers and consultants for V5, and will be handling much of the lore and setting for this edition of the game. As co-developer of Beckett's Jyhad Diary for V20, he is well-placed to help steer our vision for the Vampire metaplot.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Matthew possesses a depth of writing and development experience, having contributed for books by Onyx Path Publishing, Chaosium, Cubicle 7, and Green Ronin, among others. He's also known for his entertaining and educational Gentlemen's Guide to Vampire and Pentex Guide to Werewolves videos on Youtube.&quot;</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Couldn't happen to a nicer guy!</span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>For different game play videos of White Wolf Games from my play group<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBUyj7h-xIhwsM3kHK56SRA\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBU...IhwsM3kHK56SRA</a><br /> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night\" target=\"_blank\">https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night</a><br /> If you want to find White Wolf game play media or subject matter media<br /> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/</a>","edited":{"userid":11618,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11618-christopherzacher","user":"ChristopherZacher","date":". 10-02-2017, 04:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11618-christopherzacher","name":"ChristopherZacher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11618_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"631"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-02T11:18:13-07:00","id":1146104,"title":"","content":"Matthew is currently my favorite game writer.<br /> <br /> He knows the material, pays homage to previous editions, concepts and characters, and never strongly inserts his own political agenda and/or bias while STILL writing with same concepts(fighting the man and punching UP) and themes old White Wolf was known for. It's his stuff that reminds me of the WW games that I fell in love with all those years ago. <br /> <br /> He definitely deserves it.<br /> <br /> I look forward to more Action Bill references in the future : P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}